#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:3
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "Wheel"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``Wheel`` class represents a motorized wheel of the robot. It "
"encapsulates a ``Motor`` object provided by Webots."
msgstr ""
"La classe ``Wheel`` représente une roue motorisée du robot. Elle "
"encapsule un objet ``Motor`` fourni par Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:14
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:16
msgid "Store a Webots motor."
msgstr "Stocker un moteur Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:17
msgid "Configure the motor for continuous rotation."
msgstr "Configurer le moteur en rotation continue."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:18
msgid "Apply a speed to the wheel."
msgstr "Appliquer une vitesse à la roue."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:19
msgid "Stop the wheel."
msgstr "Arrêter la roue."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:23
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:25
msgid "The class encapsulates the Webots ``Motor`` object in a private attribute:"
msgstr ""
"La classe encapsule l'objet Webots ``Motor`` dans un attribut privé :"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:31
msgid ""
"The other classes do not directly manipulate the Webots motor. They use "
"the public methods of ``Wheel``."
msgstr ""
"Les autres classes ne manipulent pas directement le moteur Webots. Elles "
"utilisent les méthodes publiques de ``Wheel``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:36
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:38
msgid ""
"``Wheel`` is used by ``DriveBase``. ``DriveBase`` owns four ``Wheel`` "
"objects. ``Wheel`` also depends on the Webots ``Motor`` class."
msgstr ""
"``Wheel`` est utilisée par ``DriveBase``. ``DriveBase`` possède quatre "
"objets ``Wheel``. ``Wheel`` dépend aussi de la classe Webots ``Motor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:43
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:46
msgid "``Wheel(Motor motor)``"
msgstr "``Wheel(Motor motor)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:48
msgid ""
"Class constructor. It receives a Webots ``Motor`` object and stores it. "
"If the motor exists, it is configured for continuous rotation using "
"``setPosition(Double.POSITIVE_INFINITY)`` and its speed is initialized to"
" ``0.0``."
msgstr ""
"Constructeur de la classe. Il reçoit un objet ``Motor`` Webots et le "
"stocke. Si le moteur existe, il est configuré en rotation continue avec "
"``setPosition(Double.POSITIVE_INFINITY)`` et sa vitesse est initialisée à "
"``0.0``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:54
msgid "``setVelocity(double velocity)``"
msgstr "``setVelocity(double velocity)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:56
msgid ""
"Applies a speed to the wheel. The method checks that the motor is not "
"``null`` before calling ``setVelocity``."
msgstr ""
"Applique une vitesse à la roue. La méthode vérifie que le moteur n'est "
"pas ``null`` avant d'appeler ``setVelocity``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:60
msgid "``stop()``"
msgstr "``stop()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/wheel.rst:62
msgid "Stops the wheel by calling ``setVelocity(0.0)``."
msgstr "Arrête la roue en appelant ``setVelocity(0.0)``."